#사용법은 https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/http-client-in-product-code-editor.html

### Get companies with API version
GET http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Accept: application/vnd.darkchoco+json;v=1.0

### Send Contact Message
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Accept: application/vnd.darkchoco+json;v=1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "김수정",
  "email": "crystal@cloudscape.kr",
  "userType": "Job Seeker",
  "subject": "Facing technical problem",
  "message": "Facing technical problem while uploading Resume"
}